      "title": "WHO ASKS",
      "columns": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "lead": "Clients",
          "text": "Clients are synthwerk-studio, synthwerk-widgets and the SDK apps. They ask, identity answers."
        },
        {
          "lead": "Stack",
          "text": "Go 1.27."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "usage",
      "type": "notes",
      "title": "WHERE IT FITS",
      "columns": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "lead": "Ecosystem map",
          "text": "[synthwerk](https://github.com/VelimirMueller/synthwerk). One repo per role. Start there."
        },
        {
          "lead": "Blueprint",
          "text": "Shared CI, lint configs and templates: [synthwerk-blueprint](https://github.com/VelimirMueller/synthwerk-blueprint)."
        },
        {
          "lead": "Renamed",
          "text": "This repo was renamed. The old URL still redirects here."
        },
        {
          "lead": "Legacy code",
          "text": "The tag `legacy-final` keeps the old service: a Kotlin/Quarkus prototype with hard-coded users and no tokens."
        },
        {
          "lead": "Branching",
          "text": "`main` deploys to dev, a `vX.Y.Z` tag to stg, an approved digest to prd."
        },
        {
          "lead": "License",
          "text": "MIT. Copyright 2025 Velimir Müller."
        }
      ]
